{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfJjhGZaeF7obmwHPqs72","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FGUck3gytrMcYXtVjYq6vZ","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"passes":["fail","fail","fail","unknown","fail","fail","fail","fail","pass","pass"],"defects":["crown-pinnate-arching-fronds (core): in render-0 and render-1 the crown is a flat starburst of ~25-35 straight, radially spread axes of near-equal length with no arching and no downward recurve; no frond hangs below the crown insertion point. reference-0 shows long fronds curving outward then strongly downward, with the lowest fronds drooping well below the crown base and the crown outline reading as a rounded shuttlecock. Defining mismatch.","owner-fronds-long-arching (owner priority 1): frond length in render-0/render-1 is roughly 0.15-0.2 of trunk height and the axes are nearly bare; in reference-0 frond length is a large fraction of trunk length and the blades are dense and heavy. The owner's named first dials (leaflet size, frond length) are not yet moved to reference scale at either seed.","leaflet-arrangement-stiff-narrow (core): leaflets in render-0/render-1/render-2 read as sparse dark speckles and short stubs scattered along thin rachides, with large gaps of bare axis; the frond has no plumose V-sectioned mass and no bristly continuous margin. reference-0/reference-1/reference-2 show densely inserted narrow stiff leaflets in groups at differing angles. Defining mismatch.","owner-trunk-straight-constant (owner priority 2): the trunk in render-0 and render-2 is distinctly wavy - an S-curve in the upper third plus an angular knee/bulge at mid-height where the silhouette steps outward; render-1 (seed 42) is straighter overall but still carries a visible waviness and the same mid-trunk knee. reference-0 shows a smooth single lean/curve and reference-1/reference-2 are essentially straight; none is wavy. Defining mismatch at both seeds.","soli