ailures are not seed-specific.","render-2 (P-TRUNK) is the clearest view of the trunk surface: a smooth shaded tube with a soft specular gradient and no geometric or textured detail at any height.","The trunk is bare of any epiphytes, sprouts or foliage in both P-WHOLE renders, matching the owner's third priority; note the reference epiphytic ferns in reference-1/reference-2 are scene features the inventory itself records as variation, not species character.","Finish quality relative to anchor-0 (spruce): the render's ground plane, sky gradient and trunk shading are at a comparable stylistic level, but the foliage reads as aliased speckle rather than the anchor's coherent needle mass. The anchor bears on finish only and no morphology conclusion is drawn from it.","frond-colour-range (variation, uncertain in the inventory): the render foliage is a dark desaturated green with black speckling in render-0/render-1 and a brighter green in render-2; this sits within the inventory's recorded reference colour spread and is treated as acceptable variation, not a defect.","trunk-lean-and-curve is a recorded variation trait in the inventory (leaning/S-curved in reference-0 vs straight in reference-1/reference-2); the render's failure is not the lean but the high-frequency waviness and the angular mid-trunk knee, which no reference shows.","dead-frond-skirt, petiole-base-orange-sheath, crown-shaft-absent, basal-leaflet-spines and trunk-colour-and-weathering are secondary refinements; their absence is recorded but not treated as blocking.","Improvement over any prior state is not assessed here and would not substitute for the unmet core traits."],"findings":[{"observation":"Crown is a flat radial starburst of short straight sparse axes at both seeds; no arching, no drooping lower fronds.","evidence_ids":["render-0","render-1","render-2","reference-0","reference-1"],"impact":"blocker","uncertain":false,"causal_hypothesis":"Consistent with frond length and leaflet size dials still